(Kandal): Preah Po Vongsa Pov Ratana, Preah Reachanakom, Honorary Committee of Preah Samuh, Kandal Province, and Preah Vinay, Sub-district of Kien Svay District, and a total of 32 pagodas throughout the district and Chbar Ampov pagoda donated a lot of money, materials and food. To the Committee for Combating Kovid 19 in Kien Svay District.
Preah Po Vongsa Pov Ratana said that this is a contribution to alleviate the hardships of the most vulnerable and vulnerable people in Kien Svay district during our nation as well as countries around the world are experiencing a deadly disease. Which are easily infected and kill people quickly.
Therefore, all these funds, materials and food can be used to alleviate the hardships of some of our people who are in need, and can also be used to buy alcohol, gel, soap, mask or krama to prevent the transmission of Kovid 19 disease because of the disease. Kovid 19 can be infected at any time if we all lack hygiene, especially in public places.
