But there are also a small number of people who stubbornly want to meet on New Year, dissatisfied with this decision. Please do not think too selfishly, please open your heart, sacrifice a little and participate a little for the happiness of our nation. I would like to suggest some ideas for you to consider:
Our country, as well as the rest of the world, is seriously facing the spread of Kovid 19 virus. The challenges and epidemics of some countries in the world because the stubborn people do not listen to the instructions of the Royal Government are insulting and underestimating the disease of Kovid 19. They overcame rallies, rejoiced, lacked foresight, and eventually led to the country's pandemic, where many lives were lost.
It is true that now is the time for family reunion and the most important national festival, but it can also be a great disaster for our family and our nation.
Example: If you have fun, you can spread the disease to your family and community members. After the meeting in our district, each of us returns to work, what if Kovid comes with you, what will be the result? Kovid is the hidden enemy of the world.
So sacrificing a little happiness for a lot of long-term happiness, sacrificing this year's happiness for many years to come, sacrificing this year's reunion for many years to come, these are our wise sacrifices. .
We accept short-term pain for our long-term happiness and well-being, we are less free in the short term for our lifelong freedom, that is, the freedom to live without Kovid. "There is no greater freedom than the freedom of survival." This is the most appropriate sacrifice.
If we are happy for a short time and destroy a great deal of happiness, then this kind of pleasure is the most foolish pleasure that does not suit us, so we should not be happy like that at all. We must not be happy for just three or four days, ruining the joy of a lifetime.
Each of us sacrificed only three or four days for our nation to escape the spread of Kovid-19, considered a great sacrifice for our nation. Our country needs citizens who dare to sacrifice like this for the nation.
Many of our ancestors and generations, including his life, to save the country and defend the country, can we sacrifice only three or four days to save the country and protect our country from Kovid's beating? I believe we can do it.
Our head of government, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, has done everything to protect the people and the country from the spread of the Kovid virus. In the face of such an epidemic, there is no choice but to listen and participate in the implementation of government rules. Please do not listen to false information that leads to the destruction of our country.
In these difficult circumstances, the nation really needs the sacrifice of every citizen, each sacrificing only three or four days for our nation to be free from Kovid. I believe we can do it for our country.
