Take a look at the picture below: AMK continues to provide responsible financial services despite the spread of Kovid-19 virus
(Phnom Penh): In the context of Cambodia's joint fight against the spread of Kovid-19 virus, AMK continues to provide financial services to its clients responsibly and contribute to the implementation of measures. And guidelines of the Ministry of Health.
The Company has introduced measures to protect the well-being of its customers as well as its employees, in particular AMK has introduced its customers to use financial services through the AMK Mobile App to contribute to the implementation of the social gap guidelines of the Ministry of Health. .
Kea Boran, CEO of AMK Microfinance Institution, said: “We continue to provide good service to our clients with a high sense of responsibility, fully supporting and implementing the measures issued by the Ministry of Health to "Prevent and control the spread of this infectious disease."
"The well-being and safety of our customers and employees is our most precious asset," he said. In the past, we have regularly disseminated and reminded how to protect ourselves and reduce the risk to employees, customers, as well as the general public through various educational messages, images and short educational videos made on social media and other media. As an AMK partner.
He added that instead of being shocked and frightened, he would like to encourage all Cambodians to understand this disease clearly and participate in the implementation of preventive measures to protect themselves, their families and society from this disease.
Taking this opportunity, he would like to express his gratitude and appreciation to the Royal Government of Cambodia, as well as the Ministry of Health, relevant ministries, local authorities, doctors and all medical staff who are committed and work hard and do not think of fatigue. Helping to protect and save the lives of Cambodians.
It should also be noted that all AMK customers and staff are asked to take a temperature and wash their hands with alcohol before being allowed inside the office. In addition, all AMK offices are scheduled to be thoroughly cleaned, disinfected, and thoroughly protected.
To this day, all customers are still able to operate smoothly across the network of operations across the country, such as in the office of ATMs through agents, especially the AMK Mobile App, which allows him to operate smoothly. Extensive without holding cash as well.
