Natural disasters! Lightning strikes couple in Bavet city, Svay Rieng province
(Svay Rieng): A couple was tragically killed by lightning while the victims were riding a motorcycle taxi from work to go home. This case happened at 17:30 on April 8, 2020 in Prasat village, Sangkat Prasat, Bavet city, Svay Rieng province.
Bavet police said that before the incident, there was rain mixed with strong winds, thunder and lightning, suddenly shot two people, a couple traveling on the road, causing the death of both.
