He added that the experience gained has the advantage of being a strong foundation to become a professional producer with clear technical accuracy, quality, safety standards, this is the capital to compete with foreign products in the future. Not only that, this community is also a source of sharing or exchanging experiences gained from practice to communities or other producers throughout the district.
