(Kandal): Joint police cracked down on and confiscated 2 illegal containers of damaged chicken knees, ducks and pig's organs in Kien Svay district, Kandal province on April 8, 2020 in a warehouse in Chey Udom village, Samrong Thom commune, Kien Svay district. And illegal stockpiling.
Mr. Ol Dorin, Director of Production and Veterinary Office of the Department of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries of Kandal Province, said that these goods were all defective and the owner of this place did not apply for a permit to transport, import and stockpile meat production. .
After the inspection team inspected the vehicle, the results showed that the frozen pork intestines in the container were damaged and had a bad smell. Prosecutors then decided to temporarily store the above exhibits at the scene, closing both containers and waiting for further proceedings.
Meanwhile, the materials and equipment of the Customs and Excise Branch were temporarily kept at the same warehouse location, waiting for the documents to be checked later. The owner of the goods was taken to the Kandal Provincial Police for questioning, and the goods will be confiscated to be burned.
5 Features of Hyatt Regency Hotel Phnom Penh
(Phnom Penh): The emerging Hyatt Regency Hotel Phnom Penh, located in the heart of the historical, cultural and commercial district, has many unique features to be ready to welcome tourists from all over the world in the future.
Here are five features you should know about Hyatt Regency Phnom Penh:
* The Hyatt Regency Phnom Penh International Hotel is the first Hyatt Regency hotel in the country in Cambodia. Hyatt has developed 663 hotels in 56 countries around the world, including Cambodia.
* The Hyatt Regency Phnom Penh is a hotel that preserves French colonial villas in the center of its hotel, a contribution to the preservation of French colonial architecture.
* Location: The Hyatt Regency Hotel Phnom Penh is perfectly located in the historical area overlooking the Chaktomuk River around the Royal Palace, the Royal School of Fine Arts, the National Museum, the French colonial administration area and the commercial area.
* Hyatt Regency Phnom Penh is a 5 star hotel with 248 rooms, luxury restaurant, spa, rooftop swimming pool, sky bar and underground bar.
* The Hyatt Regency Hotel Phnom Penh is the perfect choice for wedding venues, exhibition halls, major national and international conference venues.
In addition to these features, the Hyatt Regency Phnom Penh Hotel also has other special features when it officially launches in the third quarter of 2020.
