According to a press release obtained by Fresh News on April 8, 2020, the ASEAN Foreign Ministers' Meeting will discuss and exchange views on ASEAN's joint response to the outbreak. Kovid-19, as well as to prepare for the upcoming ASEAN Special Summit and the ASEAN Plus Three Special Summit on Kovid-19, which is scheduled to be held soon.
