In fact, on April 6, 2020, Mr. Keo Rattanak led the team to donate food, bicycle, gel, alcohol, hand soap and get money for each army on the occasion of Khmer New Year to the front line forces and families. Forces in the 42nd Infantry Brigade and the 702nd Border Police Battalion in the direction of Ta Moan Temple, Oddar Meanchey Province.
