The Prime Minister of Cambodia reaffirms that it is not possible for any doctor to be infected due to the lack of responsibility of the Royal Government
(Phnom Penh): Once again, through the official Facebook page of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, on the evening of April 5, 2020, he made it clear that he will not allow any Cambodian doctor who is treating Kovid 19 patients. Infected due to lack of responsibility of the Royal Government.
Samdech Techo Prime Minister said that yesterday, April 4, 2020, Samdech, on behalf of the Chairman of the National Commission for the Fight against Kovid 19, presented a new strategic plan to fight against Kovid 19, in which Ordered an additional 10 million masks, 5,000 doctor's uniforms, 500,000 doctors' masks, 5,000 N-95 masks, and 1 million liters of alcohol.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen stressed that "This is necessary because we can not infect any doctor due to our lack of responsibility." "Now I would like to issue an additional order, we need to have another level of government reserves."
According to Samdech Techo Prime Minister, both masks, clothes for doctors and alcohol, when used up, must be purchased or made to fill in stock immediately. The Royal Government's stock is kept at the Ministry of Health, but when it is withdrawn, it must be submitted to the Chairman of the National Commission for Combating Kovid 19.
The Prime Minister also ordered the Minister of Health and the Minister of Finance to increase the allowance for doctors at the front line who are on a mission to treat 19 communicable diseases.
Samdech Techo Prime Minister confirmed to the two ministers "must be prepared as soon as possible, because in recent months, the doctors have not had the opportunity to be close to their wives and children, this is a very high sacrifice. In order to prevent the relatives, nieces and nephews of these doctors from having a hard time worrying about their families at home, and to be more comfortable and able to provide health services to our people. ”
Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on the people to have confidence in the Royal Government's measures to prevent 19 communicable diseases, in which he stated that Cambodia is a poor country, but not mentally poor, we know how to control our people who arrive At this time, no patients died.
Samdech also thanked the people all over the country who joined the fight against Kovid 19 with the Royal Government.
