A truck parked on a bomb left over from the war caused an explosion that damaged the front, but did not endanger people.
(Oddar Meanchey): A truck was completely damaged at the front due to the explosion of bombs left over from the war, which happened on the morning of April 5, 2020 at Trapeang Baray, Baray village, Ampil commune, district Banteay Ampil, Oddar Meanchey Province.
According to the report of the Banteay Ampil District Police, before the incident, the owner of the car parked the car and left it for Eska to leave, and then opened the door and went out for a while, then suddenly an explosion occurred on the car. Let the front of the car be completely damaged.
