Samdech Techo Hun Sen said, "In recent months, all these doctors have not been close to their wives and children, it is a very high sacrifice, so as not to make it difficult for the doctors to think. To my family, I would like to ask you to increase the allowance for this doctor so that these doctors will not worry about the problems related to the family who are at home and have never visited each other.
The head of the Royal Government of Cambodia, who is always close to the people when the country is in trouble, expressed his belief that by increasing the allowance, all front-line doctors will be able to afford to fill The fight against COVID-19 that Cambodia is facing.
While Cambodia is facing COVID-19, all front-line doctors are working day and night to prevent the spread of this deadly pandemic. Through these difficulties, the team of doctors always perform their duties at the front line with the utmost care.
Front-line doctors have claimed that they all have a common goal: to protect their community from the pandemic. They are very proud to be pioneers in the fight against epidemics because they can carefully examine each case to avoid any recurrence, ensuring health and safety for Everyone.
