Selection to study Accounting, Finance and Business Management
(Phnom Penh): Of course, everyone in the universe always has different tastes and aspirations. Some people like to eat sweet food, some people like to eat sour food, if we look at the skills, some people want to be a lawyer, some people want to be self-employed and some people want to be self-employed. Work at the bank as well.
All in all, all skills are good and useful if we know them well. But we should study and consider carefully before deciding to choose a skill that we love, whether that skill is in high demand in today's social context?
And where should we study to acquire that skill clearly and proficiently, especially with widespread recognition?
In today's society, many people are interested in business and some people are looking for more training on how to grow their business.
When it comes to business skills, we certainly think of business-related skills, but obviously there are some basic skills that are indispensable for any company or business, and those skills are accounting skills. This skill is in high demand, both in Cambodia and in the world.
Meanwhile, Cam Ed Business School is an institution that trains undergraduate students in accounting and finance in accordance with the ACCA International Education Standards and is the first institution in Cambodia to be accredited to teach the ACCA program, and ACCA is currently Located in the United Kingdom and has members around the world in 183 countries.
In addition to studying for a four-year bachelor's degree at Cam Ed Business School, you will receive two degrees accredited by the Ministry of Education of Cambodia and accredited by the ACCA.
