This decision is effective from April 3, 2020 onwards. This is according to a letter from the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation of Cambodia sent to the diplomatic and consular mission in Cambodia, which was received by Fresh News on April 4, 2020.
The letter from the Ministry of Foreign Affairs states: "The Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation of Cambodia would like to inform all diplomatic and consular missions in Cambodia that due to the COVID-19 outbreak, tourists Play Cambodia after January 1, 2020 can not return home because there is no flight.
