Tbong Khmum Provincial Administration Completely Rejects Gambling in Dar Commune, Memot District
(Tbong Khmum): The administration of Tbong Khmum province said that on March 31, 2020, local media reported that Heng and Lim were still able to run gambling in Dar commune, Memot district, Tbong Khmum province for some reason. That Mr. Cheam Chansophoan, the provincial governor, and Mr. Ben Rath, the provincial police commissioner, did not have the will to crack down on gambling in order to strengthen social security in accordance with the nine-point village-commune safety policy.
The provincial administration would like to completely reject and reject the above information. In the past, the provincial leaders and specialized units, together with the Municipal and District Administrative Unity Command, have taken measures to disseminate education, guide and crack down on illegal gambling, drug crime, and theft. Robbery and other crimes are rampant.
Through this activity, the situation of security, public order and social security has been gradually improved, the crime rate in the province has decreased significantly until it has been encouraged by the head of the Royal Government by providing bonus cards. Praise the letter praising the implementation of the safe village-commune policy.
Please note that the above location is the address of the Gambling Entertainment Center (Casino) with a valid license issued by the Office of the Council of Ministers by letter No. 541 dated 9 May 2018.
In the case of this publication, the information is distorted, exaggerated, and does not reflect the facts in order to tarnish the reputation of the provincial leadership. On the other hand, the content and images in this article are old, repetitive, unprofessional, baseless, fabricated for personal gain and to mislead the public.
The provincial administration calls on the publisher of this newspaper to modify the content and images in the above article based on the legal principles and legal documents in force, otherwise we will take legal action.
