Chip Mong Bank provides convenience to customers through digital banking services
(Phnom Penh): Chip Mong Bank provides digital banking services with a wide range of products and services to customers, mainly online.
Chip Mong Bank's digital banking services are available to customers via the internet, mobile phones and ATMs.
Chip Mong Bank's digital banking services focus on two key principles: first, convenience and second, high security.
Chip Mong Bank's digital banking services facilitate daily financial transactions such as instant cash payments, cardless ATM withdrawals, self-created bank accounts, water bills Mobile top up and other banking services via mobile.
In addition to the above, Chip Mong Bank will also have many other special products and services to serve the needs of customers.
