The King of Khmer expressed his appreciation to the National Assembly and the Royal Government through the Royal Message on the occasion of the opening of the new term of the National Assembly this morning, April 2, 2020.
In this message, the King of Cambodia stated that the National Assembly has fulfilled its role actively and effectively, including the implementation of the role of the legislature as a representative of the people who own the electorate and the work of monitoring. Law enforcement in all walks of life has been remarkably successful.
He commended and thanked Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin, President of the National Assembly, Vice President of the National Assembly, and all members of the National Assembly for their diligent efforts in studying the draft laws in order to expand their potential and efficiency. The present era.
In this message, the King of Cambodia also noted the active efforts of the National Assembly to monitor the well-being, accept all the concerns and challenges of the people, which is now being protected by social security. Promote in the sense that all citizens benefit.
