Oknha Ly Hour, Chairman of the Board of Directors, stated that the acquisition of the commercial bank license shows the growing confidence in Ly Hour Microfinance Institution Plc. In helping to improve the Cambodian economy by providing financial services to customers and the public. .
"Obtaining this license will provide one more step for Ly Hour Microfinance Plc. To become a commercial bank that provides a wide range of financial services to a wide range of clients and the public in all provinces," he said. The capital of the Kingdom of Cambodia.
He added that Ly Hour Microfinance Institution Plc. Will be renamed "SBI Ly Hour Bank" and will start its banking business in April and will be officially launched in May. This coming June as well.
Mr. Oknha Ly Hour would like to express his deep gratitude to the National Bank of Cambodia for its continued support and trust in licensing to further strengthen and expand its services to customers and the public. Come on.
