Samdech Techo says Dimitri is an ambassador who has restored the aging relationship between Cambodia and Russia to a new level. In addition, he also arranged for the official and historic visit of the Russian Prime Minister to Cambodia and the Prince's official visit to Russia.
Samdech Techo thanked the Russian government and people for their continued assistance to Cambodia in the past and continued to assist Cambodia in matters related to the fight against false information.
