He stated that for Mondulkiri province, so far there have been no cases of suspected 19 cases of Kovid. However, the provincial authorities, including all authorities, have implemented the instructions of the Royal Government of Cambodia and have worked. Educate local people through loudspeakers and posters on how to reduce the risk of transmission of Kovid 19.
The provincial governor also called on all people to clean up and follow the instructions of the Ministry of Health to prevent the spread of this deadly disease.
