(Phnom Penh): Mr. You Bunleng, President of the Court of Appeal, on March 27, 2020, issued a statement informing all Phnom Penh Court of Appeal officials about the implementation of their jurisdiction from April 1, 2020. Continue.
In a letter from the President of the Court of Appeal, which was received by Fresh News, it was stated that from April 1, the Phnom Penh Court of Appeal has jurisdiction to resolve only cases that fall within the jurisdiction of Phnom Penh, Kandal Province. Kampong Chhnang, Kampong Speu, Takeo, Prey Veng and Svay Rieng provinces and cases that are not under the jurisdiction of the Regional Court of Appeal, except in cases where the law delegates jurisdiction to other courts.
