The Deputy Prime Minister hopes that the Russian President will attend the 13th Asia-Europe Summit in November 2020 in Phnom Penh, Cambodia, which is an important forum to further strengthen cooperation in all fields. Asian and European countries that will be able to have the heads of state / government of about 51 countries.
The Deputy Prime Minister said that the trade volume between Cambodia and Russia will reach 55.39 million US dollars in 2019, and hope that the trade volume between Cambodia and Russia will increase further in 2020. Meanwhile, 55,653 Russian tourists visited Cambodia in 2019, hoping that the number of Russian tourists to Cambodia will continue to increase in the coming years.
