Speaking to Fresh News this morning, March 22, 2020, Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, Governor of Preah Sihon Province, confirmed that after research and interrogation, 36 French nationals arrived in Siem Reap on March 11, 2020. They then traveled by car with two tour guides and another Cambodian driver to Sihanoukville on March 18, 2020.
The two French men infected with Kovid 19 were admitted to Sihanoukville Provincial Referral Hospital.
