Natural luxury condominium in Toul Kork area, only $ 80,000
(Phnom Penh): To meet the needs of modern customers who tend to care for the environment and connect with nature.
From the entrance of the building, the reception floor to the roof floor, all locations are meticulously designed to have fresh air, enough natural light, accompanied by beautiful green plants that make the occupants feel just fresh. Step into the perimeter of the building.
The interior design of each unit also carefully considers the natural values, with greenery along the doors, windows and front porch, creating a fresh, natural atmosphere at all times.
The glass windows in each bedroom are designed to be high enough to allow light in and out, which helps residents feel refreshed after waking up every morning under the soft sunlight in the early morning. In addition, all units have their own porch, which allows residents to relax in the cool air in the evening and enjoy the beautiful scenery of Tuol Kork.
Rich services bring a peaceful and complete life In addition to the unique natural design, this project offers a wide range of services to bring a peaceful and complete life for the residents. Residents can enjoy the state-of-the-art gym, swimming pool, sky bar, restaurant and many other entertainment services.
At the same time, this luxury condo creates mental security for the residents, equipped with modern security technology, including alarm system, security camera and 24-hour security service.
What is even more special is the smart parking lot, which can lift the occupants' vehicles to each parking lot via the automatic elevator system.
