(Phnom Penh): Officials of the General Department of CamControl of the Ministry of Commerce on the afternoon of March 18, 2020, continued to inspect pharmacies near the Olympic Market, during the operation seized several liters of counterfeit alcohol from a pharmacy. While on sale.
