On the night of March 14, 2020, the Royal Government of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, introduced a number of measures through the following circulars:
1: Advise all citizens not to travel to European countries, the United States and Iran unless absolutely necessary.
2. All ministries, state institutions, both at the national and sub-national levels, shall not allow civil servants at all levels to travel to all kinds of meetings in European countries, the United States and Iran.
3. In case of necessity that requires a representative of Cambodia to attend the meeting in the countries as mentioned above, each relevant Ministry shall make a request to the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation to appoint a representative of the Embassy in the host country. Of the meeting to attend instead.
