According to the meetings and other programs of those ministries and institutions, the participants in the program also need to measure the temperature of hand washing or disinfection, while in some places do not measure the temperature is only required to wash their hands or spray alcohol to disinfect. Hands only.
In addition to government institutions, private institutions, companies, commercial buildings, restaurants, etc., these rules also apply.
It should be noted that in order to prevent the spread of Kovit 19, on the night of March 15, 2020, the Royal Government also issued some circulars.
The circular prohibits travel to European countries, the United States and Iran unless absolutely necessary. The class travels to all kinds of meetings to European countries, the United States and Iran.
The circular added that in case of necessity, a representative of Cambodia is required to attend the meeting in the countries mentioned above, each relevant ministry must make a request to the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation to appoint a representative of the embassy in the host country. Meeting house to attend instead.
All Cambodian civil servants and citizens who have just returned from European countries, the United States and Iran must be detained within 14 days from the date of their return to Cambodia in accordance with the prescribed procedures. By the Ministry of Health.
