(Stung Treng): The newly-appointed Stung Treng Provincial Police Commissioner, Brigadier General Ot Sivutha, has ordered the Anti-Economic Crime Bureau to lead Colonel Va Sophan, Director of the Economic Crimes Bureau, to crack down on two illegal handicrafts. To the Forestry Administration Thala Parivat as well.
On the morning of March 13, 2020, under the direct command of Brigadier General Ot Sivutha, specialized forces raided two handicrafts in Sralao village, Anlong Chrey commune, Thala Borivat district, Stung Treng province. On March 9, a Samsung truck carrying illegal rosewood was also handed over to the Forestry Administration.
