(Kampong Cham): A fire broke out in the middle of the night on March 13, 2020 at Boeung Kok Market in Village 7, Sangkat Boeung Kok, Kampong Cham City, Kampong Cham Province, destroying some stalls in the market area.
Kampong Cham Provincial Police Commissioner Major General Em Kosal told Fresh News that after receiving this information, he immediately ordered professional forces to intervene to save the people. During last night's operation, Mr. Un Chanda, Governor of Kampong Cham Province, also went to direct the operation.
