Drunk, set fire to his own house, burned to the ground and left to burn down a neighbor's house, people helped to put out the fire
(Kampong Chhnang): One house was completely engulfed in fire and the other house was burnt down, one side wall was extinguished by the people in time.
This incident happened at 12 o'clock on March 13, 2020 at Koh Dey Dous, on the east bank of the river in Kandal village, Phsar Chhnang commune, Kampong Chhnang city. The two houses that caught fire quickly, one made of galvanized iron, 5 by 8 meters in size, were completely burnt down. Separately, the other one burned down one side of the wall, and the people came to help put out the fire.
According to local authorities, the incident that caused the fire in the two houses was caused by a suspect named Cheam Chanthoeun, male, 30 years old, who set his house on fire and then spread. Crossed to the fire on the other side of the neighbor's house, also because he was drunk. In the above incident caused damage to some equipment in the house as well, so far the authorities do not know the amount of damage yet.
