Mr. HUN Many's remarks through the intervention in the discussion on the agenda of the draft law on the establishment of the Ministry of Industry, Science, Technology and Innovation. Mr. Hun Many supported the decision and willingness of the Royal Government to lead and coordinate this sector successfully for the national interest.
At the same time, Mr. HUN Many took the opportunity to recall what is the will and maturity of the leadership of the Cambodian People's Party in national unity by launching and implementing the win-win policy, which is the foundation of Cambodia's development. To the present and to the future.
