The presence of Hyatt Regency Hotel Phnom Penh marks the beginning of a new era in the hotel and hospitality industry.
(Phnom Penh): The presence of Hayat Regency Hotel Phnom Penh will be a new era of hotel and hospitality industry in Phnom Penh to provide business and hospitality services for national and international tourists from all over the world.
The Hyatt Regency Phnom Penh Hotel is a five-star hotel that will open in the third quarter of 2020 with 248 rooms, a luxury restaurant, a state-of-the-art meeting room, a spa bar and more.
The Hyatt Regency Phnom Penh Hotel is located in the heart of Phnom Penh, close to the National Museum, Royal Palace, Royal University of Fine Arts, Fine Arts Hall, Veal Preah Meru, Night Market, Wat Aram and Chaktomuk River, providing convenient access for national and international visitors to Phnom Penh.
