Ouk Torona, CEO of Rona Sokleang, said that Orchidona Sokleang, a Cambodian brand, was discovered and developed by a Cambodian woman after she suffered from severe hair loss. Nothing is right.
After being fed up with the products on the market, Ms. Leng Sokleang, currently the CEO of Rona Sokleang, turned her attention to natural formulas by using 100% natural ingredients according to ancient rules. Try to treat hair loss during 2016.
As a result, Leng Sokleang's hair problems were cured, and her hair grew longer, with more hair growth, eliminating hair loss, regenerating healthy hair and shining naturally.
Rona Sokleang, CEO of Rona Sokleang, added that seeing this, Ms. Leng Sokleang decided to do a test sale for the first time in 2018. Two to three months later, this shampoo started to gain a lot of support, which led him and his wife to decide to create and craft this Orchidona Sok Leang soap with the permission of the Ministry in May. 2018.
He added that at first it was not a business, just want to share with friends or acquaintances who have hair problems. But the number of effective users increased, so he decided to set up a business to produce and sell business.
