In particular, for the big prize of 2 pink toothpaste now, she said that she and her family use 2 pink toothpaste regularly because it can treat gum disease and help whiten teeth. Clean and eliminate bad breath well.
But recently, when she ran out, she bought two new boxes of toothpaste from a seller near her house to use as usual, but when she tore the box and scratched the sticker in the box, she found a prize of 20 million. Riel at once.
Suddenly, she was very excited and told her husband and neighbors to help, and then called the company through the phone number in the box.
She stated that after receiving a big prize of 20 million Riel from the 2 pink toothpaste, she will use some to build a better house and save some for the family to buy more cows to support the family in the future. .
