"Beijing is very grateful for the encouragement as well as donations from cities around the world that have been allied since the outbreak of COVID-19 and are now consistent," Li said. While the outbreak in China is under control, but other countries around the world are suffering, Beijing wants to help the four cities to fight the disease.
