At the same time, the Secretary-General brought greetings and compliments from Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen to AFSIP, Krousar Thmey and Desperate Relief Organization, which strive to help children affected by other violence. They also train to learn and have knowledge to avoid ignorance and live a good and prosperous life in the future.
At the same time, the above three organizations also expressed their great joy as they continued to receive the attention of the exemplary leaders, especially the Cambodian Red Cross. In particular, Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, who always thinks about the well-being at all times, without leaving any children alone.
