(Phnom Penh): Borey Peng Huoth celebrated the official launch of The Star Platinum Eco Sunrise new business project at Borey Peng Huoth (Boeung Sno) sales office, just 5 minutes from Monivong Bridge (Chbar Ampov). Also, there was an invitation from the management of Peng Huot Group and a lot of customers this morning, March 12, 2020 yesterday.
